# Optional build/start-time override; public API address only, never a secret.
# Development default: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
# Production default: /api/v1 (serve frontend + API through one HTTPS domain).
# To use one shared server from local development, uncomment and replace:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://study.example.com/api/v1
# Restart Vite after changing this file; rebuild production assets after changes.
